+static char **g_environ_snap DM_KEEP;   // environ as it was before the first boot: another Switch game must not inherit this one's DM_ROMFS / DM_SAVE (restored by the stop)
+// The process-wide signal dispositions as they were before the game's boot: the game's crash and pause handlers (crash.c, hle_thread.c) and its SIGTERM ignore are put back so the
